  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「キバナオモダカ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AD%E3%83%90%E3%83%8A%E3%82%AA%E3%83%A2%E3%83%80%E3%82%AB",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 108457058,
      "text": "キバナオモダカ はオモダカ科キバナオモダカ属の多年生草本、抽水植物。かつてはハナイ科に含められていたり、クロンキスト体系とAPG IIまでは独立したキバナオモダカ科とされていた。APG IIIとAPG IVではオモダカ科に含められている。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Limnocharis flava」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Limnocharis_flava",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1354904158,
      "text": "Limnocharis flava is a species of aquatic flowering plant which is native to Mexico, Central America, South America, Cuba, Haiti and the Dominican Republic but widely naturalized in southern and southeastern Asia: India, Sri Lanka, Cambodia, Burma, Thailand, Vietnam, Indonesia, Malaysia, Brunei and southern China."
    }
